/**
 * GENERATED by tools/brand-icons/build.mjs — do not edit by hand.
 *
 * One icon set, one colouring per generated brand. Every theme draws the same Phosphor (MIT)
 * glyph for a module, on the same plate geometry in white ink, so the home board keeps one
 * shape and one icon per module whatever theme is picked. Only the plate colours
 * change, which is what lets an icon still match its theme's palette. The three neon
 * themes ship without their own cut and alias the closest vivid ramp in [aliases].
 */
